\f1\fs22 Kathy caught up to the fight as Halo was drowning Hayley in a pond. As Kathy approached, Halo relaxed. She feared it was already over. She slid to her knees at Halo\'92s side and sliced his neck wide open, immediately under his jaw. Halo rolled off Hayley and flailed, trying to stem the blood seeping from him. Kathy helped Hayley\'97gasping and sobbing and laughing\'97out of the water. Hayley threw her arms up and they embraced.\
Halo\'92s foot kicked.\
\'93Check his pockets,\'94 Hayley said with some effort.\
Kathy stood over the serial killer, fossicked and retrieved the Point of Order. She took her time examining it from all angles.\
\'93Kathy?\'94\
Kathy roared furiously at Halo\'97Hayley had her nerves frightened out of her skin. Kathy plunged the Point of Order into Halo\'92s chest.\
The fountain of blood was, frankly, disappointing.\
\'93I need more practice,\'94 Kathy said. \'93Tax! What are we going to do on our next date?\'94
